{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-10-06 16:15:00', 'title': 'HEIL STRENGTHENS NORTHEAST PRESENCE WITH NEW DEALER LOCATION IN UPSTATE NEW YORK', 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., OCT. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HEIL, PART OF ENVIRONMENTAL SOLUTIONS GROUP (ESG)\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), AND ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST REFUSE TRUCK BODY MANUFACTURERS, ANNOUNCED THE GROWTH OF ITS NATIONWIDE DEALER NETWORK WITH A NEW ENVIRONMENTAL EQUIPMENT SALES AND SERVICE (EESS) LOCATION IN ROCHESTER, NEW YORK."}